OL,3,GNEWSA'She never forgot her roots' -
OL,4,Ahometown tributes to Ciara Mageean
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer European champion and two-time
OL,7,FOlympian Ciara Mageean has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as "selfless" by staff from
OL,9,Fher former school.
OL,11,FMageean, from Portaferry in County
OL,12,FDown, was diagnosed with stage four
OL,13,Fbowel cancer in May 2025.
OL,15,FShe died on Sunday morning, surrounded
OL,16,Fby her loved ones, a statement posted
OL,17,Fon her social media accounts said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
