OL,3,GNEWSA'She never forgot her roots' -
OL,4,Ahometown tributes to Ciara Mageean
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarcelle Orsi, vice-principal of
OL,7,FAssumption Grammar School in
OL,8,FBallynahinch, said the loss will be
OL,9,Ffelt "by so many for many years to
OL,10,Fcome".
